SNAPSHOT {"helpCenterRevisions":[{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.article-edit-en-v2","documentType":"explanation","lang":"en","languageLabel":"English","version":2,"active":true,"title":"Edit article","summary":"Edit the article and review its preview before saving.","description":"Edit the article and review its preview before saving.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Edit article","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Edit the article for the selected language, including its title, text and images. Preview the result before saving, and use the saved article’s separate publication action when ready.</p>"},{"id":"guide-article-save","guideStepId":"article-save","icon":"help_outline","title":"Save","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Persist this article’s current text and media, then return to the list. Saving a new draft does not publish it; the article card provides the publication action.</p>"},{"id":"guide-article-preview","guideStepId":"article-preview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Preview","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open a reader-style preview of the current draft, including edits not yet saved. Close the preview to continue editing, then save to keep those changes.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Close","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Close the editor and discard its unsaved draft. Save first if you want to keep the current text and media changes.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.article-edit","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.article-edit-hu-v2","documentType":"explanation","lang":"hu","languageLabel":"Magyar","version":2,"active":true,"title":"Cikk szerkesztése","summary":"Szerkeszd a cikket, majd mentés előtt ellenőrizd az előnézetet.","description":"Szerkeszd a cikket, majd mentés előtt ellenőrizd az előnézetet.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Cikk szerkesztése","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A kiválasztott nyelven szerkesztheted a cikk címét, szövegét és képeit. Mentés előtt nézd meg az előnézetet; az elkészült cikk publikálását az elmentett kártya külön műveletével végezheted el.</p>"},{"id":"guide-article-save","guideStepId":"article-save","icon":"help_outline","title":"Mentés","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Elmenti a cikk aktuális szövegét és médiatartalmát, majd visszatér a listához. Az új piszkozat mentése nem publikálja azt; erre a cikk kártyáján külön művelet van.</p>"},{"id":"guide-article-preview","guideStepId":"article-preview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Előnézet","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Olvasói előnézetet nyit az aktuális piszkozatról, a még nem mentett módosításokkal együtt. Bezárása után folytathatod a szerkesztést; a változtatások megőrzéséhez ments.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Bezárás","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Bezárja a szerkesztőt, és elveti a nem mentett piszkozatot. Előbb ments, ha meg szeretnéd őrizni az aktuális szöveg- és médiamódosításokat.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.article-edit","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.article-view-en-v2","documentType":"explanation","lang":"en","languageLabel":"English","version":2,"active":false,"title":"Article preview","summary":"Review the article as displayed to readers. Close to return to the editor.","description":"Review the article as displayed to readers. Close to return to the editor.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Article preview","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Check the article’s text, images and layout as a reader would see them. A draft preview lets you review pending edits; opening it does not save or publish them.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Close","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Return to the previous surface.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.article-view","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.article-view-en-v3","documentType":"explanation","lang":"en","languageLabel":"English","version":3,"active":true,"title":"Article preview","summary":"Review the article as displayed to readers. Close to return to the editor.","description":"Review the article as displayed to readers. Close to return to the editor.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Article preview","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Check the article’s text, images and layout as a reader would see them. A draft preview lets you review pending edits; opening it does not save or publish them.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Close","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Return to the previous surface.</p>"},{"id":"guide-image-gallery-expand","guideStepId":"image-gallery-expand","icon":"help_outline","title":"Article images","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open the article image gallery. The badge shows the image count; opening it does not edit or publish the article.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.article-view","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.article-view-hu-v2","documentType":"explanation","lang":"hu","languageLabel":"Magyar","version":2,"active":false,"title":"Cikk előnézete","summary":"A cikk olvasói nézetének ellenőrzése. Bezárás után visszatérsz a szerkesztőhöz.","description":"A cikk olvasói nézetének ellenőrzése. Bezárás után visszatérsz a szerkesztőhöz.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Cikk előnézete","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Olvasói nézetben ellenőrizheted a cikk szövegét, képeit és elrendezését. A piszkozat előnézete a függő módosításokat mutatja; megnyitása nem menti és nem publikálja azokat.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Bezárás","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Visszatérés az előző felülethez.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.article-view","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.article-view-hu-v3","documentType":"explanation","lang":"hu","languageLabel":"Magyar","version":3,"active":true,"title":"Cikk előnézete","summary":"A cikk olvasói nézetének ellenőrzése. Bezárás után visszatérsz a szerkesztőhöz.","description":"A cikk olvasói nézetének ellenőrzése. Bezárás után visszatérsz a szerkesztőhöz.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Cikk előnézete","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Olvasói nézetben ellenőrizheted a cikk szövegét, képeit és elrendezését. A piszkozat előnézete a függő módosításokat mutatja; megnyitása nem menti és nem publikálja azokat.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Bezárás","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Visszatérés az előző felülethez.</p>"},{"id":"guide-image-gallery-expand","guideStepId":"image-gallery-expand","icon":"help_outline","title":"Cikk képei","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Nyisd meg a cikk képgalériáját. A jelvény a képek számát mutatja; a megnyitás nem szerkeszti és nem publikálja a cikket.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.article-view","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.help-editor-en-v2","documentType":"explanation","lang":"en","languageLabel":"English","version":2,"active":false,"title":"Content editor","summary":"Manage help, policy and editable guide revisions. System guides are maintained with the application and are hidden here.","description":"Manage help, policy and editable guide revisions. System guides are maintained with the application and are hidden here.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Content editor","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Maintain help and policy documents, and guides that allow editing. Choose a language, save a revision and activate it when ready for users. Application-managed system guides are excluded from this editor.</p>"},{"id":"guide-help-document","guideStepId":"help-document","icon":"help_outline","title":"Document","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Select the document type or editable guide you intend to maintain. For an explanation, also check its target screen so the saved steps belong to the right part of the app.</p>"},{"id":"guide-help-language","guideStepId":"help-language","icon":"help_outline","title":"Language","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Choose the content language before editing. Each language has separate revisions and an active version, so changing this selection does not translate or publish the other language.</p>"},{"id":"guide-help-new-revision","guideStepId":"help-new-revision","icon":"help_outline","title":"New revision","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Prepare a new revision of the selected document and language. Save it first, then activate the revision when it should replace the version users currently see.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Close","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Return to the previous surface.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.help-editor","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.help-editor-en-v3","documentType":"explanation","lang":"en","languageLabel":"English","version":3,"active":true,"title":"Content editor","summary":"Manage help, policy and editable guide revisions. System guides are maintained with the application and are hidden here.","description":"Manage help, policy and editable guide revisions. System guides are maintained with the application and are hidden here.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Content editor","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Maintain help and policy documents, and guides that allow editing. Choose a language, save a revision and activate it when ready for users. Application-managed system guides are excluded from this editor.</p>"},{"id":"guide-help-document","guideStepId":"help-document","icon":"help_outline","title":"Document","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Select the document type or editable guide you intend to maintain. For an explanation, also check its target screen so the saved steps belong to the right part of the app.</p>"},{"id":"guide-help-language","guideStepId":"help-language","icon":"help_outline","title":"Language","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Choose the content language before editing. Each language has separate revisions and an active version, so changing this selection does not translate or publish the other language.</p>"},{"id":"guide-help-new-revision","guideStepId":"help-new-revision","icon":"help_outline","title":"New revision","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Prepare a new revision of the selected document and language. Save it first, then activate the revision when it should replace the version users currently see.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Close","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Return to the previous surface.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-toggle","guideStepId":"revision-toggle","icon":"help_outline","title":"Revision contents","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open or collapse a saved revision to read its sections. This does not change the active version.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-active","guideStepId":"revision-active","icon":"help_outline","title":"Active version","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>This badge identifies the revision currently shown to users in the selected language.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-presentation","guideStepId":"revision-presentation","icon":"help_outline","title":"Guide format","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>This badge shows whether the saved revision uses a small tour or a full guide. It is read-only here.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-edit","guideStepId":"revision-edit","icon":"help_outline","title":"Edit revision","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open a draft based on this revision. Review its content before saving a new version.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-activate","guideStepId":"revision-activate","icon":"help_outline","title":"Activate revision","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Make this saved revision the active version for its document and language. The current active revision cannot be activated again.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-delete","guideStepId":"revision-delete","icon":"help_outline","title":"Delete revision","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Remove this saved revision through the delete action. Check the document, language and version first.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-preview","guideStepId":"section-preview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Read a section","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Expand or collapse a saved section to read its content without editing it.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-title","guideStepId":"revision-title","icon":"help_outline","title":"Revision title","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Name the draft revision so it can be identified in the revision list.</p>"},{"id":"guide-draft-presentation","guideStepId":"draft-presentation","icon":"help_outline","title":"Guide format","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Choose the supported small-tour or full-guide presentation for this draft. Save the revision to retain the choice.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-save","guideStepId":"revision-save","icon":"help_outline","title":"Save revision","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Save the current draft as a new revision. Activation is a separate action on the saved revision.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-cancel","guideStepId":"revision-cancel","icon":"help_outline","title":"Cancel editing","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Close this draft without saving the edits. Saved revisions remain available.</p>"},{"id":"guide-draft-toggle","guideStepId":"draft-toggle","icon":"help_outline","title":"Draft contents","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Expand or collapse the draft fields. Collapsing the draft does not save it.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-header","guideStepId":"revision-header","icon":"help_outline","title":"Header","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Set the heading displayed for this document or guide revision.</p>"},{"id":"guide-header-color","guideStepId":"header-color","icon":"help_outline","title":"Header color","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Choose the draft header color. The selection belongs to this revision.</p>"},{"id":"guide-canonical-screen","guideStepId":"canonical-screen","icon":"help_outline","title":"Target screen","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Choose the screen this guide describes. Check it before saving so the content belongs to the intended context.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-description","guideStepId":"revision-description","icon":"help_outline","title":"Description","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Write the introductory description for this revision.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-add","guideStepId":"section-add","icon":"help_outline","title":"Add a section","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Add another section to the draft, then fill in its title and content. This does not save the revision.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-icon","guideStepId":"section-icon","icon":"help_outline","title":"Section icon","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Choose an icon that identifies this section. Use the menu search to find an icon.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-title","guideStepId":"section-title","icon":"help_outline","title":"Section title","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Name the section as it should appear in the document or guide.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-guide-target","guideStepId":"section-guide-target","icon":"help_outline","title":"Guide target","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Link this tour section to an available control on the selected screen.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-panel-span","guideStepId":"section-panel-span","icon":"help_outline","title":"Panel width","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Choose how much of the full-guide grid this section occupies.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-optional","guideStepId":"section-optional","icon":"help_outline","title":"Privacy requirement","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Choose whether accepting this privacy section is optional or required. Review the requirement before activating the revision.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-mode","guideStepId":"section-mode","icon":"help_outline","title":"HTML or preview","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Switch between editing the section HTML and previewing its rendered content. Switching does not save the revision.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-remove","guideStepId":"section-remove","icon":"help_outline","title":"Remove section","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Remove this section from the draft. Save the revision to retain the removal.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-toggle","guideStepId":"section-toggle","icon":"help_outline","title":"Section fields","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Expand or collapse this draft section to access its content and image fields.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-html","guideStepId":"section-html","icon":"help_outline","title":"Section HTML","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Edit the section body as HTML. Use Preview to check its appearance before saving.</p>"},{"id":"guide-image-upload","guideStepId":"image-upload","icon":"help_outline","title":"Add image","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Choose an image for this empty section slot. Save the revision to retain the section images.</p>"},{"id":"guide-image-replace","guideStepId":"image-replace","icon":"help_outline","title":"Replace image","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Choose another image for this occupied section slot.</p>"},{"id":"guide-image-copy","guideStepId":"image-copy","icon":"help_outline","title":"Copy image link","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Copy this image link for use in the section content. Copying does not change the draft.</p>"},{"id":"guide-image-remove","guideStepId":"image-remove","icon":"help_outline","title":"Remove image","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Remove this image from the draft section. Save the revision to retain the change.</p>"},{"id":"guide-image-pages","guideStepId":"image-pages","icon":"help_outline","title":"Image pages","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Switch between pages of image slots to review or edit the section images.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.help-editor","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.help-editor-hu-v2","documentType":"explanation","lang":"hu","languageLabel":"Magyar","version":2,"active":false,"title":"Tartalomszerkesztő","summary":"Súgó-, szabályzat- és szerkeszthető guide-verziók. A rendszer-guide-ok az alkalmazással frissülnek, itt nem jelennek meg.","description":"Súgó-, szabályzat- és szerkeszthető guide-verziók. A rendszer-guide-ok az alkalmazással frissülnek, itt nem jelennek meg.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Tartalomszerkesztő","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Itt kezelheted a súgókat, szabályzatokat és szerkeszthető útmutatókat. Válassz nyelvet, ments verziót, majd aktiváld, amikor a felhasználóknak szánod. Az alkalmazás által kezelt rendszerútmutatók nem szerepelnek ebben a szerkesztőben.</p>"},{"id":"guide-help-document","guideStepId":"help-document","icon":"help_outline","title":"Dokumentum","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Válaszd ki a kezelendő dokumentumtípust vagy szerkeszthető útmutatót. Magyarázatnál ellenőrizd a célképernyőt is, hogy a mentett lépések az alkalmazás megfelelő részéhez tartozzanak.</p>"},{"id":"guide-help-language","guideStepId":"help-language","icon":"help_outline","title":"Nyelv","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Szerkesztés előtt válaszd ki a tartalom nyelvét. Minden nyelvhez külön verziók és aktív változat tartozik, ezért a választás nem fordítja le és nem publikálja a másik nyelvű tartalmat.</p>"},{"id":"guide-help-new-revision","guideStepId":"help-new-revision","icon":"help_outline","title":"Új verzió","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Készíts új verziót a kiválasztott dokumentumhoz és nyelvhez. Először mentsd el, majd akkor aktiváld, amikor le szeretnéd váltani a felhasználóknak jelenleg látható változatot.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Bezárás","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Visszatérés az előző felülethez.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.help-editor","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.help-editor-hu-v3","documentType":"explanation","lang":"hu","languageLabel":"Magyar","version":3,"active":true,"title":"Tartalomszerkesztő","summary":"Súgó-, szabályzat- és szerkeszthető guide-verziók. A rendszer-guide-ok az alkalmazással frissülnek, itt nem jelennek meg.","description":"Súgó-, szabályzat- és szerkeszthető guide-verziók. A rendszer-guide-ok az alkalmazással frissülnek, itt nem jelennek meg.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Tartalomszerkesztő","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Kezeld a súgókat, szabályzatokat és szerkeszthető útmutatókat. Válassz nyelvet, ments verziót, majd aktiváld. Az alkalmazás rendszerútmutatói itt nem szerkeszthetők.</p>"},{"id":"guide-help-document","guideStepId":"help-document","icon":"help_outline","title":"Dokumentum","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Válaszd ki a kezelendő dokumentumtípust vagy szerkeszthető útmutatót. Magyarázatnál ellenőrizd a célképernyőt is, hogy a mentett lépések az alkalmazás megfelelő részéhez tartozzanak.</p>"},{"id":"guide-help-language","guideStepId":"help-language","icon":"help_outline","title":"Nyelv","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Szerkesztés előtt válaszd ki a tartalom nyelvét. Minden nyelvhez külön verziók és aktív változat tartozik, ezért a választás nem fordítja le és nem publikálja a másik nyelvű tartalmat.</p>"},{"id":"guide-help-new-revision","guideStepId":"help-new-revision","icon":"help_outline","title":"Új verzió","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Készíts új verziót a kiválasztott dokumentumhoz és nyelvhez. Először mentsd el, majd akkor aktiváld, amikor le szeretnéd váltani a felhasználóknak jelenleg látható változatot.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Bezárás","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Visszatérés az előző felülethez.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-toggle","guideStepId":"revision-toggle","icon":"help_outline","title":"Verzió tartalma","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Nyisd le vagy csukd össze a mentett verziót a szakaszok áttekintéséhez. Ettől az aktív verzió nem változik.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-active","guideStepId":"revision-active","icon":"help_outline","title":"Aktív verzió","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Ez a jelvény mutatja a felhasználóknak jelenleg látható verziót a kiválasztott nyelven.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-presentation","guideStepId":"revision-presentation","icon":"help_outline","title":"Útmutató formája","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A jelvény a mentett verzió formáját mutatja: kis lépésenkénti vagy teljes útmutató. Itt csak olvasható.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-edit","guideStepId":"revision-edit","icon":"help_outline","title":"Verzió szerkesztése","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Nyiss piszkozatot ebből a verzióból. Új verzió mentése előtt ellenőrizd a tartalmát.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-activate","guideStepId":"revision-activate","icon":"help_outline","title":"Verzió aktiválása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Tedd ezt a mentett verziót aktívvá a dokumentumhoz és nyelvhez. A már aktív verzió nem aktiválható újra.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-delete","guideStepId":"revision-delete","icon":"help_outline","title":"Verzió törlése","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Ezzel a művelettel törölheted a mentett verziót. Előbb ellenőrizd a dokumentumot, a nyelvet és a verziót.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-preview","guideStepId":"section-preview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Szakasz olvasása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Nyisd le vagy csukd össze a mentett szakaszt. A tartalom olvasása nem módosítja azt.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-title","guideStepId":"revision-title","icon":"help_outline","title":"Verzió címe","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Adj címet a piszkozatnak, hogy felismerhető legyen a verziólistában.</p>"},{"id":"guide-draft-presentation","guideStepId":"draft-presentation","icon":"help_outline","title":"Útmutató formája","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Válaszd ki a piszkozat támogatott formáját: kis lépésenkénti vagy teljes útmutató. A választást a verzió mentése rögzíti.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-save","guideStepId":"revision-save","icon":"help_outline","title":"Verzió mentése","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Mentsd a piszkozatot új verzióként. Az aktiválás külön művelet a mentett verzión.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-cancel","guideStepId":"revision-cancel","icon":"help_outline","title":"Szerkesztés elvetése","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Zárd be a piszkozatot a módosítások mentése nélkül. A mentett verziók továbbra is elérhetők.</p>"},{"id":"guide-draft-toggle","guideStepId":"draft-toggle","icon":"help_outline","title":"Piszkozat tartalma","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Nyisd le vagy csukd össze a piszkozat mezőit. Az összecsukás nem menti a piszkozatot.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-header","guideStepId":"revision-header","icon":"help_outline","title":"Fejléc","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Add meg a dokumentum vagy útmutató ezen verziójának megjelenő fejlécét.</p>"},{"id":"guide-header-color","guideStepId":"header-color","icon":"help_outline","title":"Fejléc színe","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Válaszd ki a piszkozat fejlécének színét. A választás ehhez a verzióhoz tartozik.</p>"},{"id":"guide-canonical-screen","guideStepId":"canonical-screen","icon":"help_outline","title":"Célképernyő","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Válaszd ki az útmutatóhoz tartozó képernyőt. Mentés előtt ellenőrizd, hogy a tartalom a kívánt felülethez tartozik.</p>"},{"id":"guide-revision-description","guideStepId":"revision-description","icon":"help_outline","title":"Leírás","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Írd meg a verzió bevezető leírását.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-add","guideStepId":"section-add","icon":"help_outline","title":"Szakasz hozzáadása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Adj új szakaszt a piszkozathoz, majd töltsd ki a címét és tartalmát. Ez még nem menti a verziót.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-icon","guideStepId":"section-icon","icon":"help_outline","title":"Szakasz ikonja","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Válassz a szakaszt jelölő ikont. A menü keresőjével kereshetsz az ikonok között.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-title","guideStepId":"section-title","icon":"help_outline","title":"Szakasz címe","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Add meg a szakasz dokumentumban vagy útmutatóban megjelenő címét.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-guide-target","guideStepId":"section-guide-target","icon":"help_outline","title":"Útmutató célpontja","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Kapcsold ezt a lépést a kiválasztott képernyő egyik elérhető vezérlőjéhez.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-panel-span","guideStepId":"section-panel-span","icon":"help_outline","title":"Panel szélessége","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Válaszd ki, mekkora helyet foglaljon el a szakasz a teljes útmutató rácsában.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-optional","guideStepId":"section-optional","icon":"help_outline","title":"Adatvédelmi követelmény","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Állítsd be, hogy a szakasz elfogadása választható vagy kötelező. Aktiválás előtt ellenőrizd a követelményt.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-mode","guideStepId":"section-mode","icon":"help_outline","title":"HTML vagy előnézet","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Válts a szakasz HTML-kódjának szerkesztése és a megjelenő tartalom előnézete között. A váltás nem menti a verziót.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-remove","guideStepId":"section-remove","icon":"help_outline","title":"Szakasz eltávolítása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Távolítsd el ezt a szakaszt a piszkozatból. Az eltávolítást a verzió mentése rögzíti.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-toggle","guideStepId":"section-toggle","icon":"help_outline","title":"Szakasz mezői","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Nyisd le vagy csukd össze a piszkozat szakaszát a tartalom és a képmezők eléréséhez.</p>"},{"id":"guide-section-html","guideStepId":"section-html","icon":"help_outline","title":"Szakasz HTML-kódja","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Szerkeszd a szakasz tartalmának HTML-kódját. Mentés előtt az előnézetben ellenőrizd a megjelenést.</p>"},{"id":"guide-image-upload","guideStepId":"image-upload","icon":"help_outline","title":"Kép hozzáadása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Válassz képet a szakasz üres helyére. A szakasz képeit a verzió mentése rögzíti.</p>"},{"id":"guide-image-replace","guideStepId":"image-replace","icon":"help_outline","title":"Kép cseréje","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Válassz másik képet a szakasz ezen foglalt helyére.</p>"},{"id":"guide-image-copy","guideStepId":"image-copy","icon":"help_outline","title":"Képhivatkozás másolása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Másold ki a kép hivatkozását a szakasz tartalmához. A másolás nem módosítja a piszkozatot.</p>"},{"id":"guide-image-remove","guideStepId":"image-remove","icon":"help_outline","title":"Kép eltávolítása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Távolítsd el ezt a képet a piszkozat szakaszából. A módosítást a verzió mentése rögzíti.</p>"},{"id":"guide-image-pages","guideStepId":"image-pages","icon":"help_outline","title":"Képlapok","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Válts a képhelyek lapjai között a szakasz képeinek áttekintéséhez vagy szerkesztéséhez.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.help-editor","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.home-en-v2","documentType":"explanation","lang":"en","languageLabel":"English","version":2,"active":false,"title":"Administration","summary":"Open your avatar menu to choose moderation, content, jobs or monitoring. Notification and guide controls are also there.","description":"Open your avatar menu to choose moderation, content, jobs or monitoring. Notification and guide controls are also there.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Administration","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open the avatar menu to choose a task: content review, user reports, feedback, jobs or monitoring. Each opens its own workspace; personal notifications and guide visibility are controlled from the same menu.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.home","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.home-en-v3","documentType":"explanation","lang":"en","languageLabel":"English","version":3,"active":true,"title":"Administration","summary":"Open your avatar menu to choose moderation, content, jobs or monitoring. Notification and guide controls are also there.","description":"Open your avatar menu to choose moderation, content, jobs or monitoring. Notification and guide controls are also there.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Administration","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open the avatar menu to choose a task: content review, user reports, feedback, jobs or monitoring. Each opens its own workspace; personal notifications and guide visibility are controlled from the same menu.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.home","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.home-hu-v2","documentType":"explanation","lang":"hu","languageLabel":"Magyar","version":2,"active":false,"title":"Adminisztráció","summary":"Az avatar menüből nyílik a moderálás, tartalom, feladatok és megfigyelés. Az értesítés és guide kapcsolója is ott van.","description":"Az avatar menüből nyílik a moderálás, tartalom, feladatok és megfigyelés. Az értesítés és guide kapcsolója is ott van.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Adminisztráció","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Az avatármenüben válassz feladatot: tartalomellenőrzés, felhasználói bejelentések, visszajelzések, háttérfeladatok vagy monitorozás. Mindegyik saját felületet nyit; ugyanitt éred el a személyes értesítéseket és az útmutatók kapcsolóját.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.home","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.home-hu-v3","documentType":"explanation","lang":"hu","languageLabel":"Magyar","version":3,"active":true,"title":"Adminisztráció","summary":"Az avatar menüből nyílik a moderálás, tartalom, feladatok és megfigyelés. Az értesítés és guide kapcsolója is ott van.","description":"Az avatar menüből nyílik a moderálás, tartalom, feladatok és megfigyelés. Az értesítés és guide kapcsolója is ott van.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Adminisztráció","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Az avatármenüből nyithatod meg a moderációt, bejelentéseket, visszajelzéseket, háttérfeladatokat és monitorozást. Itt találod az értesítéseket és az útmutatók kapcsolóját is.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.home","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.idea-editor-en-v2","documentType":"explanation","lang":"en","languageLabel":"English","version":2,"active":true,"title":"Articles","summary":"Manage articles, drafts and published content in the selected language.","description":"Manage articles, drafts and published content in the selected language.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Articles","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Manage article drafts, published articles and trash in the selected language. Editing saves the content; publication and featured placement are separate actions on the article card.</p>"},{"id":"guide-idea-filter","guideStepId":"idea-filter","icon":"help_outline","title":"Filter","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Choose drafts for unfinished work, published or featured articles for visible content, or trash to recover a removed article. The filter changes the list without publishing or deleting anything.</p>"},{"id":"guide-idea-language","guideStepId":"idea-language","icon":"help_outline","title":"Language","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Select which language’s articles to list and edit. Check this before creating a draft or changing text so the content is saved for the intended readers.</p>"},{"id":"guide-idea-new","guideStepId":"idea-new","icon":"help_outline","title":"New article","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Start a new article in the selected language. Prepare its title, text and images, preview it, then save; publication is a separate action on the saved article.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Close","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Return to the previous surface.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.idea-editor","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-admin.idea-editor-hu-v2","documentType":"explanation","lang":"hu","languageLabel":"Magyar","version":2,"active":true,"title":"Cikkek","summary":"Cikkek, vázlatok és közzétett tartalmak kezelése a kiválasztott nyelven.","description":"Cikkek, vázlatok és közzétett tartalmak kezelése a kiválasztott nyelven.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-overview","guideStepId":"overview","icon":"help_outline","title":"Cikkek","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A kiválasztott nyelven kezelheted a cikkpiszkozatokat, publikált cikkeket és a kukát. A szerkesztő a tartalmat menti; a publikálás és a kiemelés külön művelet a cikk kártyáján.</p>"},{"id":"guide-idea-filter","guideStepId":"idea-filter","icon":"help_outline","title":"Szűrés","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A befejezetlen munkához válaszd a piszkozatokat, a látható tartalomhoz a publikált vagy kiemelt cikkeket, helyreállításhoz a kukát. A szűrő a listát változtatja, nem publikál és nem töröl.</p>"},{"id":"guide-idea-language","guideStepId":"idea-language","icon":"help_outline","title":"Nyelv","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Válaszd ki, mely nyelv cikkeit listázod és szerkeszted. Piszkozat létrehozása vagy szöveg módosítása előtt ellenőrizd, hogy a tartalom a megfelelő olvasóknak szánt nyelven mentődjön.</p>"},{"id":"guide-idea-new","guideStepId":"idea-new","icon":"help_outline","title":"Új cikk","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Új cikket kezd a kiválasztott nyelven. Készítsd el a címet, szöveget és képeket, nézd meg az előnézetet, majd ments; a publikálás az elmentett cikk külön művelete.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Bezárás","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Visszatérés az előző felülethez.</p>"}],"contextKey":"admin.idea-editor","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":true},{"_id":"community:explanation-community.voting-en-v8","documentType":"explanation","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","contextKey":"community.voting","lang":"en","languageLabel":"English","version":8,"active":false,"presentation":"tour","title":"Announcements and results","summary":"Announcements and results","description":"Announcements and results","headerColor":"teal","createdDate":"2026-10-05T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-announcements","guideStepId":"announcements","icon":"help_outline","title":"Group notices","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Read the published group notices and voting proposals. Use their menus to open details, attachments or voting as permitted.</p>"},{"id":"guide-status-trigger","guideStepId":"status:trigger","icon":"help_outline","title":"Publication status","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Switch between published, draft and deleted notices in the header.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions","guideStepId":"card-actions","icon":"touch_app","title":"Notice actions","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open details or vote from the menu. Authorized managers can edit, return a notice to draft, delete it or close voting; critical actions ask for confirmation.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-view","guideStepId":"card-actions:view","icon":"touch_app","title":"Details","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Read the full announcement, its attachments and any voting information. Opening it is read-only and does not cast a vote.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-feedback","guideStepId":"card-actions:feedback","icon":"touch_app","title":"Discuss notice","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open the support conversation linked to this announcement to ask the community’s managers a question or give feedback. Your message is separate from a vote.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-vote","guideStepId":"card-actions:vote","icon":"touch_app","title":"Vote","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open the voting view and read the proposal before choosing. Submitting asks for confirmation; once recorded, your vote cannot be changed.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-results","guideStepId":"card-actions:results","icon":"touch_app","title":"Results","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open this closed vote to inspect the recorded result. The voting round has ended, so this view is for reviewing the outcome rather than submitting another vote.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-edit","guideStepId":"card-actions:edit","icon":"touch_app","title":"Edit","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Edit the announcement’s text, attachments and supported voting settings. Save the editor to retain changes; use the list’s publication action when a draft is ready to appear.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-publish","guideStepId":"card-actions:publish","icon":"touch_app","title":"Publish","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Publish this draft announcement in its community after confirmation. Review the text, attachments and any voting deadline before approving publication.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-unpublish","guideStepId":"card-actions:unpublish","icon":"touch_app","title":"Return to draft","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Withdraw this published announcement back to draft after confirmation. It leaves the published list but remains available to its managers for editing.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-restore","guideStepId":"card-actions:restore","icon":"touch_app","title":"Restore","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Restore this announcement from trash as a draft after confirmation. Review it in the draft list and publish separately when you want it to appear again.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-trash","guideStepId":"card-actions:trash","icon":"touch_app","title":"Move to trash","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Move this announcement to trash after confirming its title. It leaves the current list; use the trash filter if you later need to restore it as a draft.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-close","guideStepId":"card-actions:close","icon":"touch_app","title":"Close voting","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>End this voting round after confirmation, even if its deadline has not yet arrived. The recorded votes form the closed result and no further votes can be submitted.</p>"},{"id":"guide-create","guideStepId":"create","icon":"help_outline","title":"Create notice or vote","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Prepare a new announcement for the current community with text, attachments and, when needed, a voting deadline. Save the draft, then publish it from the list when ready.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Close","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Close the voting list and return to the previous screen. Submitted votes and completed publication or closure actions remain recorded.</p>"}]},{"_id":"community:explanation-community.voting-en-v9","documentType":"explanation","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","contextKey":"community.voting","lang":"en","languageLabel":"English","version":9,"active":true,"presentation":"tour","title":"Announcements and results","summary":"Announcements and results","description":"Announcements and results","headerColor":"teal","createdDate":"2026-10-05T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-announcements","guideStepId":"announcements","icon":"help_outline","title":"Group notices","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Read the published group notices and voting proposals. Use their menus to open details, attachments or voting as permitted.</p>"},{"id":"guide-status-trigger","guideStepId":"status:trigger","icon":"help_outline","title":"Publication status","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Switch between published, draft and deleted notices in the header.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions","guideStepId":"card-actions","icon":"touch_app","title":"Notice actions","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open details or vote from the menu. Authorized managers can edit, return a notice to draft, delete it or close voting; critical actions ask for confirmation.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-view","guideStepId":"card-actions:view","icon":"touch_app","title":"Details","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Read the full announcement, its attachments and any voting information. Opening it is read-only and does not cast a vote.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-feedback","guideStepId":"card-actions:feedback","icon":"touch_app","title":"Discuss notice","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open the support conversation linked to this announcement to ask the community’s managers a question or give feedback. Your message is separate from a vote.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-vote","guideStepId":"card-actions:vote","icon":"touch_app","title":"Vote","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open the voting view and read the proposal before choosing. Submitting asks for confirmation; once recorded, your vote cannot be changed.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-results","guideStepId":"card-actions:results","icon":"touch_app","title":"Results","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open this closed vote to inspect the recorded result. The voting round has ended, so this view is for reviewing the outcome rather than submitting another vote.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-edit","guideStepId":"card-actions:edit","icon":"touch_app","title":"Edit","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Edit the announcement’s text, attachments and supported voting settings. Save the editor to retain changes; use the list’s publication action when a draft is ready to appear.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-publish","guideStepId":"card-actions:publish","icon":"touch_app","title":"Publish","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Publish this draft announcement in its community after confirmation. Review the text, attachments and any voting deadline before approving publication.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-unpublish","guideStepId":"card-actions:unpublish","icon":"touch_app","title":"Return to draft","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Withdraw this published announcement back to draft after confirmation. It leaves the published list but remains available to its managers for editing.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-restore","guideStepId":"card-actions:restore","icon":"touch_app","title":"Restore","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Restore this announcement from trash as a draft after confirmation. Review it in the draft list and publish separately when you want it to appear again.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-trash","guideStepId":"card-actions:trash","icon":"touch_app","title":"Move to trash","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Move this announcement to trash after confirming its title. It leaves the current list; use the trash filter if you later need to restore it as a draft.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-close","guideStepId":"card-actions:close","icon":"touch_app","title":"Close voting","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>End this voting round after confirmation, even if its deadline has not yet arrived. The recorded votes form the closed result and no further votes can be submitted.</p>"},{"id":"guide-create","guideStepId":"create","icon":"help_outline","title":"Create notice or vote","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Prepare a new announcement for the current community with text, attachments and, when needed, a voting deadline. Save the draft, then publish it from the list when ready.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Close","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Close the voting list and return to the previous screen. Submitted votes and completed publication or closure actions remain recorded.</p>"},{"id":"guide-row-status","guideStepId":"row-status","icon":"touch_app","title":"Voting progress","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Read the number of votes cast and eligible voters on the notice badge. The badge shows progress; opening the proposal and casting a vote are separate actions.</p>"}]},{"_id":"community:explanation-community.voting-hu-v8","documentType":"explanation","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","contextKey":"community.voting","lang":"hu","languageLabel":"Magyar","version":8,"active":false,"presentation":"tour","title":"Hirdetmények és eredmények","summary":"Hirdetmények és eredmények","description":"Hirdetmények és eredmények","headerColor":"teal","createdDate":"2026-10-05T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-announcements","guideStepId":"announcements","icon":"help_outline","title":"Csoporthirdetmények","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Olvasd el a közzétett csoporthirdetményeket és szavazási javaslatokat. A menüben érhetők el a részletek, mellékletek és a jogosultság szerinti szavazás.</p>"},{"id":"guide-status-trigger","guideStepId":"status:trigger","icon":"help_outline","title":"Közzétételi állapot","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A fejlécben válthatsz a közzétett, piszkozat és törölt hirdetmények között.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions","guideStepId":"card-actions","icon":"touch_app","title":"Hirdetményműveletek","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A menüből megnyithatod a részleteket vagy szavazhatsz. A jogosult kezelő szerkeszthet, visszatehet piszkozatba, törölhet vagy lezárhatja a szavazást; a kritikus műveletek megerősítést kérnek.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-view","guideStepId":"card-actions:view","icon":"touch_app","title":"Részletek","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Elolvashatod a teljes közleményt, mellékleteit és esetleges szavazási adatait. A megnyitás csak olvasás, nem ad le szavazatot.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-feedback","guideStepId":"card-actions:feedback","icon":"touch_app","title":"Hirdetmény megbeszélése","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megnyitja a közleményhez kapcsolódó támogatási beszélgetést, ahol kérdezhetsz a közösség kezelőitől vagy visszajelezhetsz. Az üzenet a szavazattól különálló művelet.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-vote","guideStepId":"card-actions:vote","icon":"touch_app","title":"Szavazás","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Nyisd meg a szavazási nézetet, és választás előtt olvasd el a javaslatot. A leadás megerősítést kér; a rögzített szavazatodat utána nem módosíthatod.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-results","guideStepId":"card-actions:results","icon":"touch_app","title":"Eredmények","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megnyitja a lezárt szavazás rögzített eredményét. A szavazási kör véget ért, ezért itt az eredményt tekintheted át, új szavazatot nem adhatsz le.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-edit","guideStepId":"card-actions:edit","icon":"touch_app","title":"Szerkesztés","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Szerkesztheted a közlemény szövegét, mellékleteit és a támogatott szavazási beállításokat. A módosításokat a szerkesztőben mentsd; az elkészült piszkozatot a lista publikálási műveletével teheted láthatóvá.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-publish","guideStepId":"card-actions:publish","icon":"touch_app","title":"Közzététel","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megerősítés után publikálja a piszkozat közleményt a közösségében. Jóváhagyás előtt nézd át a szöveget, mellékleteket és az esetleges szavazási határidőt.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-unpublish","guideStepId":"card-actions:unpublish","icon":"touch_app","title":"Vissza piszkozatba","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megerősítés után visszavonja a publikált közleményt piszkozatra. Kikerül a közzétett listából, de kezelőinek szerkeszthető marad.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-restore","guideStepId":"card-actions:restore","icon":"touch_app","title":"Visszaállítás","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megerősítés után piszkozatként visszaállítja a közleményt a kukából. Nézd át a piszkozatok között, majd külön publikáld, amikor újra láthatóvá szeretnéd tenni.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-trash","guideStepId":"card-actions:trash","icon":"touch_app","title":"Törlés","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A cím megerősítése után a kukába helyezi a közleményt. Kikerül az aktuális listából; későbbi, piszkozatként történő visszaállításhoz a kukaszűrőt használd.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-close","guideStepId":"card-actions:close","icon":"touch_app","title":"Szavazás lezárása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megerősítés után lezárja a szavazási kört akkor is, ha a határidő még nem telt le. A rögzített szavazatok adják a lezárt eredményt, további szavazat nem küldhető be.</p>"},{"id":"guide-create","guideStepId":"create","icon":"help_outline","title":"Hirdetmény vagy szavazás létrehozása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Új közleményt készíthetsz az aktuális közösségnek szöveggel, mellékletekkel és szükség esetén szavazási határidővel. Mentsd a piszkozatot, majd elkészülte után publikáld a listából.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Bezárás","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Bezárja a szavazási listát, és visszatér az előző képernyőre. A beküldött szavazatok, valamint a végrehajtott publikálási és lezárási műveletek rögzítve maradnak.</p>"}]},{"_id":"community:explanation-community.voting-hu-v9","documentType":"explanation","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","contextKey":"community.voting","lang":"hu","languageLabel":"Magyar","version":9,"active":true,"presentation":"tour","title":"Hirdetmények és eredmények","summary":"Hirdetmények és eredmények","description":"Hirdetmények és eredmények","headerColor":"teal","createdDate":"2026-10-05T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-announcements","guideStepId":"announcements","icon":"help_outline","title":"Csoporthirdetmények","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Olvasd el a közzétett csoporthirdetményeket és szavazási javaslatokat. A menüben érhetők el a részletek, mellékletek és a jogosultság szerinti szavazás.</p>"},{"id":"guide-status-trigger","guideStepId":"status:trigger","icon":"help_outline","title":"Közzétételi állapot","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A fejlécben válthatsz a közzétett, piszkozat és törölt hirdetmények között.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions","guideStepId":"card-actions","icon":"touch_app","title":"Hirdetményműveletek","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A menüből megnyithatod a részleteket vagy szavazhatsz. A jogosult kezelő szerkeszthet, visszatehet piszkozatba, törölhet vagy lezárhatja a szavazást; a kritikus műveletek megerősítést kérnek.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-view","guideStepId":"card-actions:view","icon":"touch_app","title":"Részletek","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Elolvashatod a teljes közleményt, mellékleteit és esetleges szavazási adatait. A megnyitás csak olvasás, nem ad le szavazatot.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-feedback","guideStepId":"card-actions:feedback","icon":"touch_app","title":"Hirdetmény megbeszélése","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megnyitja a közleményhez kapcsolódó támogatási beszélgetést, ahol kérdezhetsz a közösség kezelőitől vagy visszajelezhetsz. Az üzenet a szavazattól különálló művelet.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-vote","guideStepId":"card-actions:vote","icon":"touch_app","title":"Szavazás","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Nyisd meg a szavazási nézetet, és választás előtt olvasd el a javaslatot. A leadás megerősítést kér; a rögzített szavazatodat utána nem módosíthatod.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-results","guideStepId":"card-actions:results","icon":"touch_app","title":"Eredmények","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megnyitja a lezárt szavazás rögzített eredményét. A szavazási kör véget ért, ezért itt az eredményt tekintheted át, új szavazatot nem adhatsz le.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-edit","guideStepId":"card-actions:edit","icon":"touch_app","title":"Szerkesztés","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Szerkesztheted a közlemény szövegét, mellékleteit és a támogatott szavazási beállításokat. A módosításokat a szerkesztőben mentsd; az elkészült piszkozatot a lista publikálási műveletével teheted láthatóvá.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-publish","guideStepId":"card-actions:publish","icon":"touch_app","title":"Közzététel","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megerősítés után publikálja a piszkozat közleményt a közösségében. Jóváhagyás előtt nézd át a szöveget, mellékleteket és az esetleges szavazási határidőt.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-unpublish","guideStepId":"card-actions:unpublish","icon":"touch_app","title":"Vissza piszkozatba","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megerősítés után visszavonja a publikált közleményt piszkozatra. Kikerül a közzétett listából, de kezelőinek szerkeszthető marad.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-restore","guideStepId":"card-actions:restore","icon":"touch_app","title":"Visszaállítás","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megerősítés után piszkozatként visszaállítja a közleményt a kukából. Nézd át a piszkozatok között, majd külön publikáld, amikor újra láthatóvá szeretnéd tenni.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-trash","guideStepId":"card-actions:trash","icon":"touch_app","title":"Törlés","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A cím megerősítése után a kukába helyezi a közleményt. Kikerül az aktuális listából; későbbi, piszkozatként történő visszaállításhoz a kukaszűrőt használd.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-close","guideStepId":"card-actions:close","icon":"touch_app","title":"Szavazás lezárása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megerősítés után lezárja a szavazási kört akkor is, ha a határidő még nem telt le. A rögzített szavazatok adják a lezárt eredményt, további szavazat nem küldhető be.</p>"},{"id":"guide-create","guideStepId":"create","icon":"help_outline","title":"Hirdetmény vagy szavazás létrehozása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Új közleményt készíthetsz az aktuális közösségnek szöveggel, mellékletekkel és szükség esetén szavazási határidővel. Mentsd a piszkozatot, majd elkészülte után publikáld a listából.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Bezárás","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Bezárja a szavazási listát, és visszatér az előző képernyőre. A beküldött szavazatok, valamint a végrehajtott publikálási és lezárási műveletek rögzítve maradnak.</p>"},{"id":"guide-row-status","guideStepId":"row-status","icon":"touch_app","title":"A szavazás állása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A jelvény a leadott szavazatok és a szavazásra jogosultak számát mutatja. Az állás megtekintése, a javaslat megnyitása és a szavazat leadása külön művelet.</p>"}]},{"_id":"community:explanation-event.members-en-v7","documentType":"explanation","lang":"en","languageLabel":"English","version":7,"active":true,"title":"Event members","summary":"Review participation and manage requests.","description":"Check member roles and status, focus on pending requests, and invite eligible people when your role allows it.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-members-list","guideStepId":"members-list","icon":"touch_app","title":"Member cards","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Review member profiles, roles, and participation status. The list helps organizers understand who is attending and which requests still need a response.</p>"},{"id":"guide-pending-only","guideStepId":"pending-only","icon":"help_outline","title":"Show pending requests","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Turn this filter on to focus on people whose requests are not resolved yet. Turn it off to return to the full member list.</p>"},{"id":"guide-invite","guideStepId":"invite","icon":"help_outline","title":"Invite participants","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open the invitation flow to add eligible people to the event. Confirm the event and recipients before sending, since this creates new invitations.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Close member list","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Return to the event or activity that opened this member list. Closing the guide keeps the list open so you can continue reviewing people.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions","guideStepId":"card-actions","icon":"help_outline","title":"Actions for this person","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>The menu applies to this person’s membership. Role and participation state determine which actions are available.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-involvement","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-involvement","icon":"help_outline","title":"Where this person participates","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Shows the person’s participation across activities. Use it to understand their assignments before changing membership.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-toggleorganizerparticipation","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-toggleOrganizerParticipation","icon":"help_outline","title":"Organizer or participant","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Organizer only separates management from attendance. Count as participant includes this organizer in event participation.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-promoteadmin","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-promoteAdmin","icon":"help_outline","title":"Grant management rights","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Promotion gives this member administrative or manager permissions for the current event or asset. It changes their role, not your own.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-revokemanager","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-revokeManager","icon":"help_outline","title":"Remove management rights","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Revocation removes this member’s manager role. Review the confirmation to distinguish role changes from removing participation.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-stepdownadmin","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-stepDownAdmin","icon":"help_outline","title":"Give up your manager role","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Stepping down removes your management role in this context. It does not promote someone else in your place.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-approve","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-approve","icon":"help_outline","title":"Accept a pending request","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Approval accepts this pending participation request. Review the member and event before confirming; this changes their admission state.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-remove","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-remove","icon":"help_outline","title":"Remove this membership","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>The effect depends on the current state: an invitation, request or existing membership may be removed. Read the confirmation before continuing.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-leave","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-leave","icon":"help_outline","title":"End your participation","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Leaving ends your participation in this event. The confirmation explains any relevant booking or payment consequences.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-disqualify","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-disqualify","icon":"help_outline","title":"Exclude from the competition","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Disqualification changes this participant’s tournament status. Check the person and stage before confirming the exclusion.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-reinstate","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-reinstate","icon":"help_outline","title":"Undo disqualification","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Reinstatement reverses this participant’s disqualified status where the current stage allows it. Review the confirmation before applying it.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-report","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-report","icon":"help_outline","title":"Report a concern","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A report sends the described concern for review. It does not directly change the reported person’s role or participation.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-status","guideStepId":"card-status","icon":"touch_app","title":"Why participation is pending","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Invitation pending: the guest must respond. Waiting for approval: an admin must decide. Waiting for payment: payment is unfinished. The icon also distinguishes member roles.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-state-detail","guideStepId":"card-state-detail","icon":"touch_app","title":"Participation state","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>This label flags payment still due or a removed membership. The menu shows which actions are available in the current state.</p>"},{"id":"guide-member-profile","guideStepId":"member-profile","icon":"touch_app","title":"View this person","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Opens the profile details this person makes visible to you. Viewing a profile does not change their membership or role.</p>"},{"id":"guide-member-grantvote","guideStepId":"member-grantVote","icon":"help_outline","title":"Grant voting rights","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Give an accepted group member voting rights after confirmation. The Voter badge identifies eligible members; rights belong to the member, not an inferred apartment.</p>"},{"id":"guide-member-revokevote","guideStepId":"member-revokeVote","icon":"help_outline","title":"Revoke voting rights","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Confirm the warning-colored action to remove this member’s voting eligibility. The badge updates with the saved result.</p>"}],"contextKey":"event.members","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community"},{"_id":"community:explanation-event.members-hu-v7","documentType":"explanation","lang":"hu","languageLabel":"Magyar","version":7,"active":true,"title":"Esemény résztvevői","summary":"Részvétel és kérelmek áttekintése.","description":"Ellenőrizd a tagok szerepét és állapotát, szűrj függő kérelmekre, és jogosultság esetén hívj meg további embereket.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-members-list","guideStepId":"members-list","icon":"touch_app","title":"Tagkártyák","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Nézd át a tagok profilját, szerepét és részvételi állapotát. A lista segít a szervezőknek látni, ki vesz részt és mely kérelmek várnak válaszra.</p>"},{"id":"guide-pending-only","guideStepId":"pending-only","icon":"help_outline","title":"Függő kérelmek mutatása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Kapcsold be a szűrőt a még el nem bírált kérelmek megjelenítéséhez. Kikapcsolva visszatérhetsz a teljes taglistához.</p>"},{"id":"guide-invite","guideStepId":"invite","icon":"help_outline","title":"Résztvevők meghívása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Nyisd meg a meghívási folyamatot jogosult emberek eseményhez adásához. Küldés előtt ellenőrizd az eseményt és a címzetteket, mert új meghívók jönnek létre.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Taglista bezárása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Visszatérhetsz ahhoz az eseményhez vagy aktivitáshoz, amely megnyitotta a listát. A guide bezárása nyitva hagyja a taglistát, így folytathatod az áttekintést.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions","guideStepId":"card-actions","icon":"help_outline","title":"Műveletek ezzel a személlyel","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A menü ennek a személynek a tagságát kezeli. A szerepkör és részvételi állapot határozza meg az elérhető műveleteket.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-involvement","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-involvement","icon":"help_outline","title":"Miben vesz részt?","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megmutatja, mely programrészekben vesz részt a személy. Tagságmódosítás előtt így áttekintheted a hozzárendeléseit.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-toggleorganizerparticipation","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-toggleOrganizerParticipation","icon":"help_outline","title":"Szervező vagy résztvevő","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A csak szervező szerep elválasztja a kezelést a részvételtől. Résztvevőként számolva a szervező az esemény részvételében is szerepel.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-promoteadmin","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-promoteAdmin","icon":"help_outline","title":"Kezelési jogok adása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Előléptetéssel a tag kezelési jogokat kap az adott eseményhez vagy eszközhöz. Az ő szerepköre változik, nem a tiéd.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-revokemanager","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-revokeManager","icon":"help_outline","title":"Kezelési jogok visszavonása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A visszavonás megszünteti a tag kezelői szerepét. A megerősítésnél különítsd el a szerepváltozást a részvétel törlésétől.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-stepdownadmin","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-stepDownAdmin","icon":"help_outline","title":"Saját kezelői szerep feladása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A visszalépés megszünteti a saját kezelői szerepedet ebben a környezetben. Nem léptet elő automatikusan mást a helyedre.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-approve","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-approve","icon":"help_outline","title":"Függő kérelem elfogadása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A jóváhagyás elfogadja ezt a függő részvételi kérelmet. Ellenőrizd a személyt és az eseményt: a belépési állapota változik.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-remove","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-remove","icon":"help_outline","title":"E tagság eltávolítása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Az állapottól függően meghívás, kérelem vagy meglévő tagság törlődik. Folytatás előtt olvasd el a megerősítést.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-leave","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-leave","icon":"help_outline","title":"Saját részvétel megszüntetése","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A kilépés megszünteti a részvételedet ebben az eseményben. A megerősítés mutatja az esetleges foglalási és fizetési következményeket.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-disqualify","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-disqualify","icon":"help_outline","title":"Kizárás a versenyből","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A kizárás megváltoztatja a résztvevő versenyállapotát. Megerősítés előtt ellenőrizd a személyt és a szakaszt.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-reinstate","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-reinstate","icon":"help_outline","title":"Kizárás visszavonása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A visszaállítás visszavonja a résztvevő kizárt állapotát, ha az aktuális szakasz engedi. Alkalmazás előtt olvasd el a megerősítést.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-report","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-report","icon":"help_outline","title":"Probléma jelzése","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A jelentés a leírt problémát felülvizsgálatra küldi. Nem módosítja közvetlenül a jelentett személy szerepét vagy részvételét.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-status","guideStepId":"card-status","icon":"touch_app","title":"Mire vár a részvétel?","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Függő meghívásnál a vendég válasza, jóváhagyásra várva az admin döntése, fizetésre várva a befizetés hiányzik. Az ikon a tagszerepeket is jelzi.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-state-detail","guideStepId":"card-state-detail","icon":"touch_app","title":"Részvételi állapot","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A felirat hátralévő fizetést vagy eltávolított tagságot jelez. A menü az aktuális állapotban elérhető műveleteket mutatja.</p>"},{"id":"guide-member-profile","guideStepId":"member-profile","icon":"touch_app","title":"A személy adatlapja","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megnyitja a személy számodra látható profiladatait. A megtekintés nem módosítja a tagságát vagy szerepkörét.</p>"},{"id":"guide-member-grantvote","guideStepId":"member-grantVote","icon":"help_outline","title":"Szavazati jog adása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megerősítés után szavazati jogot adhatsz az elfogadott csoporttagnak. A Szavazó jelvény jelzi a jogosultságot; a jog a taghoz tartozik, nem egy feltételezett lakáshoz.</p>"},{"id":"guide-member-revokevote","guideStepId":"member-revokeVote","icon":"help_outline","title":"Szavazati jog elvétele","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A figyelmeztető színű művelet megerősítésével elveheted a tag szavazati jogát. A jelvény a mentett eredményt követi.</p>"}],"contextKey":"event.members","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community"},{"_id":"community:explanation-members-en-v5","documentType":"explanation","lang":"en","languageLabel":"English","version":5,"active":true,"title":"Members","summary":"People, roles and membership decisions.","description":"Understand available actions in the current member list.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-members-list","guideStepId":"members-list","icon":"touch_app","title":"Member cards","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Review people and roles for the group, asset or conversation named above. Membership state determines who can participate and which requests need a decision.</p>"},{"id":"guide-pending-only","guideStepId":"pending-only","icon":"help_outline","title":"Show pending requests","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Turn this filter on to focus on people whose requests are not resolved yet. Turn it off to return to the full member list.</p>"},{"id":"guide-invite","guideStepId":"invite","icon":"help_outline","title":"Invite participants","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Opens invitations for this group, asset or conversation. Review recipients before sending; opening the chooser does not send invitations.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Close member list","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Returns to the screen that opened this member list. Closing the guide alone keeps the member list open.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions","guideStepId":"card-actions","icon":"help_outline","title":"Actions for this person","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>The menu applies to this person’s membership. Role and participation state determine which actions are available.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-involvement","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-involvement","icon":"help_outline","title":"Where this person participates","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Shows the person’s participation across activities. Use it to understand their assignments before changing membership.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-toggleorganizerparticipation","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-toggleOrganizerParticipation","icon":"help_outline","title":"Organizer or participant","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Organizer only separates management from attendance. Count as participant includes this organizer in event participation.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-promoteadmin","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-promoteAdmin","icon":"help_outline","title":"Grant management rights","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Gives this member management permissions in the current group, asset or conversation. Review the scope before changing their role.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-revokemanager","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-revokeManager","icon":"help_outline","title":"Remove management rights","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Revocation removes this member’s manager role. Review the confirmation to distinguish role changes from removing participation.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-stepdownadmin","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-stepDownAdmin","icon":"help_outline","title":"Give up your manager role","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Stepping down removes your management role in this context. It does not promote someone else in your place.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-approve","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-approve","icon":"help_outline","title":"Accept a pending request","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Accepts a pending membership request in this context. Check the person and the group or asset named above before confirming.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-remove","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-remove","icon":"help_outline","title":"Remove this membership","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>The effect depends on the current state: an invitation, request or existing membership may be removed. Read the confirmation before continuing.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-leave","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-leave","icon":"help_outline","title":"End your participation","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Ends your membership in the current context. Review the confirmation for its effect on your access and any linked bookings.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-disqualify","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-disqualify","icon":"help_outline","title":"Exclude from the competition","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Disqualification changes this participant’s tournament status. Check the person and stage before confirming the exclusion.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-reinstate","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-reinstate","icon":"help_outline","title":"Undo disqualification","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Reinstatement reverses this participant’s disqualified status where the current stage allows it. Review the confirmation before applying it.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-report","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-report","icon":"help_outline","title":"Report a concern","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A report sends the described concern for review. It does not directly change the reported person’s role or participation.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-status","guideStepId":"card-status","icon":"touch_app","title":"Why participation is pending","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Invitation pending: the guest must respond. Waiting for approval: an admin must decide. Waiting for payment: payment is unfinished. The icon also distinguishes member roles.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-state-detail","guideStepId":"card-state-detail","icon":"touch_app","title":"Participation state","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>This label flags payment still due or a removed membership. The menu shows which actions are available in the current state.</p>"},{"id":"guide-member-profile","guideStepId":"member-profile","icon":"touch_app","title":"View this person","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Opens the profile details this person makes visible to you. Viewing a profile does not change their membership or role.</p>"},{"id":"guide-member-grantvote","guideStepId":"member-grantVote","icon":"help_outline","title":"Grant voting rights","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Give an accepted group member voting rights after confirmation. The Voter badge identifies eligible members; rights belong to the member, not an inferred apartment.</p>"},{"id":"guide-member-revokevote","guideStepId":"member-revokeVote","icon":"help_outline","title":"Revoke voting rights","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Confirm the warning-colored action to remove this member’s voting eligibility. The badge updates with the saved result.</p>"}],"contextKey":"members","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community"},{"_id":"community:explanation-members-hu-v5","documentType":"explanation","lang":"hu","languageLabel":"Magyar","version":5,"active":true,"title":"Tagok","summary":"Személyek, szerepek és tagsági döntések.","description":"Az aktuális taglista elérhető műveleteinek magyarázata.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-members-list","guideStepId":"members-list","icon":"touch_app","title":"Tagkártyák","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A fent megnevezett csoport, eszköz vagy beszélgetés tagjait és szerepeit mutatja. Az állapot jelzi a részvételt és a döntésre váró kérelmeket.</p>"},{"id":"guide-pending-only","guideStepId":"pending-only","icon":"help_outline","title":"Függő kérelmek mutatása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Kapcsold be a szűrőt a még el nem bírált kérelmek megjelenítéséhez. Kikapcsolva visszatérhetsz a teljes taglistához.</p>"},{"id":"guide-invite","guideStepId":"invite","icon":"help_outline","title":"Résztvevők meghívása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Meghívást készít elő ehhez a csoporthoz, eszközhöz vagy beszélgetéshez. Küldés előtt ellenőrizd a címzetteket; a választó megnyitása még nem küld meghívást.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"close","title":"Taglista bezárása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Visszatér ahhoz a felülethez, amelyből a taglistát megnyitottad. A guide bezárása önmagában nyitva hagyja a taglistát.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions","guideStepId":"card-actions","icon":"help_outline","title":"Műveletek ezzel a személlyel","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A menü ennek a személynek a tagságát kezeli. A szerepkör és részvételi állapot határozza meg az elérhető műveleteket.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-involvement","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-involvement","icon":"help_outline","title":"Miben vesz részt?","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megmutatja, mely programrészekben vesz részt a személy. Tagságmódosítás előtt így áttekintheted a hozzárendeléseit.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-toggleorganizerparticipation","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-toggleOrganizerParticipation","icon":"help_outline","title":"Szervező vagy résztvevő","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A csak szervező szerep elválasztja a kezelést a részvételtől. Résztvevőként számolva a szervező az esemény részvételében is szerepel.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-promoteadmin","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-promoteAdmin","icon":"help_outline","title":"Kezelési jogok adása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Kezelési jogosultságot ad a tagnak az adott csoportban, eszköznél vagy beszélgetésben. A szerep módosítása előtt ellenőrizd a hatókört.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-revokemanager","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-revokeManager","icon":"help_outline","title":"Kezelési jogok visszavonása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A visszavonás megszünteti a tag kezelői szerepét. A megerősítésnél különítsd el a szerepváltozást a részvétel törlésétől.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-stepdownadmin","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-stepDownAdmin","icon":"help_outline","title":"Saját kezelői szerep feladása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A visszalépés megszünteti a saját kezelői szerepedet ebben a környezetben. Nem léptet elő automatikusan mást a helyedre.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-approve","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-approve","icon":"help_outline","title":"Függő kérelem elfogadása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Elfogad egy függő tagsági kérelmet. Megerősítés előtt ellenőrizd a személyt és a fent megnevezett csoportot vagy eszközt.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-remove","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-remove","icon":"help_outline","title":"E tagság eltávolítása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Az állapottól függően meghívás, kérelem vagy meglévő tagság törlődik. Folytatás előtt olvasd el a megerősítést.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-leave","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-leave","icon":"help_outline","title":"Saját részvétel megszüntetése","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megszünteti a tagságodat az adott helyen. A megerősítésnél ellenőrizd a hozzáférésre és kapcsolódó foglalásokra gyakorolt hatását.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-disqualify","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-disqualify","icon":"help_outline","title":"Kizárás a versenyből","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A kizárás megváltoztatja a résztvevő versenyállapotát. Megerősítés előtt ellenőrizd a személyt és a szakaszt.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-reinstate","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-reinstate","icon":"help_outline","title":"Kizárás visszavonása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A visszaállítás visszavonja a résztvevő kizárt állapotát, ha az aktuális szakasz engedi. Alkalmazás előtt olvasd el a megerősítést.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-actions-member-report","guideStepId":"card-actions:member-report","icon":"help_outline","title":"Probléma jelzése","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A jelentés a leírt problémát felülvizsgálatra küldi. Nem módosítja közvetlenül a jelentett személy szerepét vagy részvételét.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-status","guideStepId":"card-status","icon":"touch_app","title":"Mire vár a részvétel?","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Függő meghívásnál a vendég válasza, jóváhagyásra várva az admin döntése, fizetésre várva a befizetés hiányzik. Az ikon a tagszerepeket is jelzi.</p>"},{"id":"guide-card-state-detail","guideStepId":"card-state-detail","icon":"touch_app","title":"Részvételi állapot","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A felirat hátralévő fizetést vagy eltávolított tagságot jelez. A menü az aktuális állapotban elérhető műveleteket mutatja.</p>"},{"id":"guide-member-profile","guideStepId":"member-profile","icon":"touch_app","title":"A személy adatlapja","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megnyitja a személy számodra látható profiladatait. A megtekintés nem módosítja a tagságát vagy szerepkörét.</p>"},{"id":"guide-member-grantvote","guideStepId":"member-grantVote","icon":"help_outline","title":"Szavazati jog adása","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Megerősítés után szavazati jogot adhatsz az elfogadott csoporttagnak. A Szavazó jelvény jelzi a jogosultságot; a jog a taghoz tartozik, nem egy feltételezett lakáshoz.</p>"},{"id":"guide-member-revokevote","guideStepId":"member-revokeVote","icon":"help_outline","title":"Szavazati jog elvétele","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>A figyelmeztető színű művelet megerősítésével elveheted a tag szavazati jogát. A jelvény a mentett eredményt követi.</p>"}],"contextKey":"members","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community"},{"_id":"community:explanation-navigation.menu-en-v10","documentType":"explanation","lang":"en","languageLabel":"English","version":10,"active":true,"title":"Avatar menu","summary":"Choose a workspace or application section.","description":"Understand account tools, community features and activity states.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-navigation-profile","guideStepId":"navigation-profile","icon":"help_outline","title":"Edit the active profile","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>The pencil opens the active profile: photos, personal details and preferences. Save in that editor to apply changes.</p>"},{"id":"guide-navigation-workspace","guideStepId":"navigation-workspace","icon":"help_outline","title":"Who you act for","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Switch between your personal profile and available group workspaces. The selected workspace determines whose content and permissions you use.</p>"},{"id":"guide-notifications","guideStepId":"notifications","icon":"help_outline","title":"Updates requiring attention","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open notifications directly. Use the existing mute control in the notification popup to hide or restore the floating alert. Notifications and unread counts are kept.</p>"},{"id":"guide-explanations","guideStepId":"explanations","icon":"help_outline","title":"Show contextual guides","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Turns the guide button off or back on permanently. The lightbulb offers step-by-step help. Drag the lightbulb or bell to move it; drop on the red X to hide it temporarily.</p>"},{"id":"guide-settings","guideStepId":"settings","icon":"help_outline","title":"Account and application tools","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Opens help, privacy, terms and account actions. Read the relevant confirmation before choosing a destructive action such as deleting the account.</p>"},{"id":"guide-feed","guideStepId":"feed","icon":"help_outline","title":"Photos with event context","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Browse shared photos or create a post. Each uploaded feed photo needs an event link before the post can be submitted for moderation.</p>"},{"id":"guide-followed","guideStepId":"followed","icon":"help_outline","title":"Keep track of organizers","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Shows events from followed organizers. Following helps you find their events; it does not book a place or join those events.</p>"},{"id":"guide-groups","guideStepId":"groups","icon":"help_outline","title":"Community membership","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Review your groups, invitations and requests, or explore other communities. Membership and acting in a group workspace are separate choices.</p>"},{"id":"guide-impressions","guideStepId":"impressions","icon":"help_outline","title":"How others experienced you","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Shows feedback-based impressions of you as host and attendee. These describe past experiences, rather than editable profile preferences.</p>"},{"id":"guide-navigation-feedback","guideStepId":"navigation-feedback","icon":"help_outline","title":"Reflect on attended events","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Review pending and completed event feedback. This is feedback about participation; application support is available separately in Settings.</p>"},{"id":"guide-rates","guideStepId":"rates","icon":"help_outline","title":"Review profile ratings","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Shows your rating activity and its available filters. Rating a profile is separate from accepting an invitation or joining an event.</p>"},{"id":"guide-chat","guideStepId":"chat","icon":"help_outline","title":"Conversations by context","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Opens conversations for events, groups, contacts and support. Use context filters to find the correct conversation before sending a message.</p>"},{"id":"guide-invitations","guideStepId":"invitations","icon":"help_outline","title":"Requests for your participation","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Review invitations and their event details before responding. An invitation alone does not mean your participation or payment is confirmed.</p>"},{"id":"guide-events","guideStepId":"events","icon":"help_outline","title":"Participation and hosting","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Find events you attend or manage, plus pending and other states. The scope selector separates these roles and lifecycle states.</p>"},{"id":"guide-payment-history","guideStepId":"payment-history","icon":"help_outline","title":"Payments and refunds","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Review payment records and refund states. A pending refund is still in progress; opening this list does not start a payment or refund.</p>"},{"id":"guide-transport","guideStepId":"transport","icon":"help_outline","title":"Vehicles and rides","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Manage transport assets and inspect their availability. Owning a vehicle and joining a place on an event’s assigned vehicle are different actions.</p>"},{"id":"guide-accommodation","guideStepId":"accommodation","icon":"help_outline","title":"Places to stay","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Manage accommodation assets, capacity and availability. Booking or joining an assigned stay has its own review and confirmation flow.</p>"},{"id":"guide-supplies","guideStepId":"supplies","icon":"help_outline","title":"Equipment and contributions","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Manage supply assets and quantities. Event assignments and contributions determine how those supplies are used by a particular activity.</p>"},{"id":"guide-tickets","guideStepId":"tickets","icon":"help_outline","title":"Entry tickets","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>View available ticket records and their state. Tickets represent entry rights; payment history records the associated financial transactions.</p>"},{"id":"guide-contacts","guideStepId":"contacts","icon":"help_outline","title":"People and contact requests","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Review contacts and incoming requests. The badge highlights pending requests, so it can differ from the total number of saved contacts.</p>"},{"id":"guide-close","guideStepId":"close","icon":"help_outline","title":"Return to the current screen","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Closes the avatar menu without opening another section.</p>"},{"id":"guide-settings-permissions","guideStepId":"settings:permissions","icon":"help_outline","title":"Install and enable device features","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Opens application installation and permission settings. Device permissions control which features can use notifications or location.</p>"},{"id":"guide-settings-share","guideStepId":"settings:share","icon":"help_outline","title":"Share the application","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Opens sharing options for this application. It shares the application link rather than your private profile settings.</p>"},{"id":"guide-settings-help","guideStepId":"settings:help","icon":"help_outline","title":"Read the full help","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Opens the active help document. Its version badge identifies the published help revision available in this installation.</p>"},{"id":"guide-settings-feedback","guideStepId":"settings:feedback","icon":"help_outline","title":"Send application feedback","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Opens application feedback for questions or suggestions. Use event feedback separately to describe an attended event.</p>"},{"id":"guide-settings-report-bugs","guideStepId":"settings:report-bugs","icon":"help_outline","title":"Report a reproducible defect","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Opens the project’s issue page in another tab. Describe what you did, what happened and what you expected.</p>"},{"id":"guide-settings-privacy","guideStepId":"settings:privacy","icon":"help_outline","title":"Review data handling","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Opens the current privacy document. Its version identifies which published data-handling terms you are reading.</p>"},{"id":"guide-settings-terms","guideStepId":"settings:terms","icon":"help_outline","title":"Review usage conditions","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Opens the current application terms. These describe application use; individual events and assets may have additional policies.</p>"},{"id":"guide-settings-delete-account","guideStepId":"settings:delete-account","icon":"help_outline","title":"Start account deletion","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Opens the account deletion flow. Read its consequences before confirming; closing the guide does not delete the account.</p>"},{"id":"guide-settings-logout","guideStepId":"settings:logout","icon":"help_outline","title":"End this signed-in session","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Signs you out of the current session. You must sign in again to continue actions that require your account.</p>"},{"id":"guide-campaigns","guideStepId":"campaigns","icon":"help_outline","title":"Campaigns","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Manage your campaigns here. Create a draft, publish it and open its Ratings action to review interest in that campaign.</p>"},{"id":"guide-cases","guideStepId":"cases","icon":"help_outline","title":"Cases","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open cases for the current Community context. Enter a group to create a group case. Scheduled tasks open from the case header.</p>"},{"id":"guide-services","guideStepId":"services","icon":"help_outline","title":"Services","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Manage your service offers and staff, or inspect your provider calendar. Publishing makes an offer available in discovery.</p>"},{"id":"guide-votes","guideStepId":"votes","icon":"help_outline","title":"Community voting","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open the group’s voting proposals and results. Read a proposal before casting your final vote.</p>"}],"contextKey":"navigation.menu","presentation":"tour","baseGroupId":"myscoutee-community","isSystem":false},{"_id":"community:explanation-navigation.menu-en-v9","documentType":"explanation","lang":"en","languageLabel":"English","version":9,"active":false,"title":"Avatar menu","summary":"Choose a workspace or application section.","description":"Understand account tools, community features and activity states.","headerColor":"violet","createdDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","createdUser":"system","updatedDate":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","updatedUser":"system","sections":[{"id":"guide-navigation-profile","guideStepId":"navigation-profile","icon":"help_outline","title":"Edit the active profile","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>The pencil opens the active profile: photos, personal details and preferences. Save in that editor to apply changes.</p>"},{"id":"guide-navigation-workspace","guideStepId":"navigation-workspace","icon":"help_outline","title":"Who you act for","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Switch between your personal profile and available group workspaces. The selected workspace determines whose content and permissions you use.</p>"},{"id":"guide-notifications","guideStepId":"notifications","icon":"help_outline","title":"Updates requiring attention","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Open notifications directly. Use the existing mute control in the notification popup to hide or restore the floating alert. Notifications and unread counts are kept.</p>"},{"id":"guide-explanations","guideStepId":"explanations","icon":"help_outline","title":"Show contextual guides","blurb":"","contentHtml":"<p>Turns the guide button off or back on permanently. The lightbulb offers step-by-step help. Drag the lightbulb or bell to move it; drop on the red X to hide it temporarily.</p>"},{"id":"guide-settings","guideStepId":"settings","icon":"help_outline","title":"Account and application too