or this draft. Save the revision to retain the choice."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-draft-presentation-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.draft-presentation.label","lang":"en","value":"Guide format"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-draft-toggle-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.draft-toggle.description","lang":"en","value":"Expand or collapse the draft fields. Collapsing the draft does not save it."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-draft-toggle-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.draft-toggle.label","lang":"en","value":"Draft contents"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-header-color-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.header-color.description","lang":"en","value":"Choose the draft header color. The selection belongs to this revision."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-header-color-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.header-color.label","lang":"en","value":"Header color"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-image-copy-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-copy.description","lang":"en","value":"Copy this image link for use in the section content. Copying does not change the draft."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-image-copy-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-copy.label","lang":"en","value":"Copy image link"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-image-pages-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-pages.description","lang":"en","value":"Switch between pages of image slots to review or edit the section images."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-image-pages-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-pages.label","lang":"en","value":"Image pages"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-image-remove-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-remove.description","lang":"en","value":"Remove this image from the draft section. Save the revision to retain the change."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-image-remove-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-remove.label","lang":"en","value":"Remove image"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-image-replace-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-replace.description","lang":"en","value":"Choose another image for this occupied section slot."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-image-replace-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-replace.label","lang":"en","value":"Replace image"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-image-upload-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-upload.description","lang":"en","value":"Choose an image for this empty section slot. Save the revision to retain the section images."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-image-upload-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-upload.label","lang":"en","value":"Add image"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-activate-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-activate.description","lang":"en","value":"Make this saved revision the active version for its document and language. The current active revision cannot be activated again."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-activate-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-activate.label","lang":"en","value":"Activate revision"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-active-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-active.description","lang":"en","value":"This badge identifies the revision currently shown to users in the selected language."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-active-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-active.label","lang":"en","value":"Active version"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-cancel-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-cancel.description","lang":"en","value":"Close this draft without saving the edits. Saved revisions remain available."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-cancel-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-cancel.label","lang":"en","value":"Cancel editing"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-delete-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-delete.description","lang":"en","value":"Remove this saved revision through the delete action. Check the document, language and version first."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-delete-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-delete.label","lang":"en","value":"Delete revision"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-description-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-description.description","lang":"en","value":"Write the introductory description for this revision."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-description-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-description.label","lang":"en","value":"Description"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-edit-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-edit.description","lang":"en","value":"Open a draft based on this revision. Review its content before saving a new version."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-edit-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-edit.label","lang":"en","value":"Edit revision"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-header-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-header.description","lang":"en","value":"Set the heading displayed for this document or guide revision."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-header-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-header.label","lang":"en","value":"Header"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-presentation-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-presentation.description","lang":"en","value":"This badge shows whether the saved revision uses a small tour or a full guide. It is read-only here."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-presentation-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-presentation.label","lang":"en","value":"Guide format"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-save-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-save.description","lang":"en","value":"Save the current draft as a new revision. Activation is a separate action on the saved revision."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-save-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-save.label","lang":"en","value":"Save revision"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-title-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-title.description","lang":"en","value":"Name the draft revision so it can be identified in the revision list."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-title-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-title.label","lang":"en","value":"Revision title"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-toggle-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-toggle.description","lang":"en","value":"Open or collapse a saved revision to read its sections. This does not change the active version."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-toggle-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-toggle.label","lang":"en","value":"Revision contents"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-add-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-add.description","lang":"en","value":"Add another section to the draft, then fill in its title and content. This does not save the revision."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-add-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-add.label","lang":"en","value":"Add a section"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-guide-target-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-guide-target.description","lang":"en","value":"Link this tour section to an available control on the selected screen."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-guide-target-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-guide-target.label","lang":"en","value":"Guide target"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-html-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-html.description","lang":"en","value":"Edit the section body as HTML. Use Preview to check its appearance before saving."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-html-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-html.label","lang":"en","value":"Section HTML"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-icon-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-icon.description","lang":"en","value":"Choose an icon that identifies this section. Use the menu search to find an icon."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-icon-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-icon.label","lang":"en","value":"Section icon"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-mode-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-mode.description","lang":"en","value":"Switch between editing the section HTML and previewing its rendered content. Switching does not save the revision."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-mode-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-mode.label","lang":"en","value":"HTML or preview"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-optional-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-optional.description","lang":"en","value":"Choose whether accepting this privacy section is optional or required. Review the requirement before activating the revision."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-optional-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-optional.label","lang":"en","value":"Privacy requirement"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-panel-span-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-panel-span.description","lang":"en","value":"Choose how much of the full-guide grid this section occupies."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-panel-span-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-panel-span.label","lang":"en","value":"Panel width"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-preview-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-preview.description","lang":"en","value":"Expand or collapse a saved section to read its content without editing it."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-preview-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-preview.label","lang":"en","value":"Read a section"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-remove-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-remove.description","lang":"en","value":"Remove this section from the draft. Save the revision to retain the removal."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-remove-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-remove.label","lang":"en","value":"Remove section"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-title-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-title.description","lang":"en","value":"Name the section as it should appear in the document or guide."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-title-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-title.label","lang":"en","value":"Section title"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-toggle-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-toggle.description","lang":"en","value":"Expand or collapse this draft section to access its content and image fields."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-admin-help-editor-section-toggle-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-toggle.label","lang":"en","value":"Section fields"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-community-voting-row-status-description","key":"guide.community.voting.row-status.description","lang":"en","value":"Read the number of votes cast and eligible voters on the notice badge. The badge shows progress; opening the proposal and casting a vote are separate actions."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-community-voting-row-status-label","key":"guide.community.voting.row-status.label","lang":"en","value":"Voting progress"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-navigation-menu-votes-description","key":"guide.navigation.menu.votes.description","lang":"en","value":"Open the group’s voting proposals and results. Read a proposal before casting your final vote."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-navigation-menu-votes-label","key":"guide.navigation.menu.votes.label","lang":"en","value":"Community voting"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-payment-cash-receipt-currency-description","key":"guide.payment.cash.receipt.currency.description","lang":"en","value":"Choose the currency of the received payment. The saved history entry and any later refund use this amount and currency together."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-payment-cash-receipt-method-description","key":"guide.payment.cash.receipt.method.description","lang":"en","value":"Choose cash or bank transfer to match how you received the payment. Saving records the receipt; it does not initiate a bank transfer."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-payment-cash-receipt-method-label","key":"guide.payment.cash.receipt.method.label","lang":"en","value":"Payment method"},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-payment-history-record-cash-description","key":"guide.payment.history.record-cash.description","lang":"en","value":"Record cash or a bank transfer you have already received. Choose the payer, method, amount and currency before saving the receipt."},{"_id":"i18n-message-en-guide-payment-history-record-cash-label","key":"guide.payment.history.record-cash.label","lang":"en","value":"Record payment received"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-article-edit-close-description","key":"guide.admin.article-edit.close.description","lang":"hu","value":"Bezárja a szerkesztőt, és elveti a nem mentett piszkozatot. Előbb ments, ha meg szeretnéd őrizni az aktuális szöveg- és médiamódosításokat."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-article-view-image-gallery-expand-description","key":"guide.admin.article-view.image-gallery-expand.description","lang":"hu","value":"Nyisd meg a cikk képgalériáját. A jelvény a képek számát mutatja; a megnyitás nem szerkeszti és nem publikálja a cikket."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-article-view-image-gallery-expand-label","key":"guide.admin.article-view.image-gallery-expand.label","lang":"hu","value":"Cikk képei"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-canonical-screen-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.canonical-screen.description","lang":"hu","value":"Válaszd ki az útmutatóhoz tartozó képernyőt. Mentés előtt ellenőrizd, hogy a tartalom a kívánt felülethez tartozik."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-canonical-screen-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.canonical-screen.label","lang":"hu","value":"Célképernyő"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-draft-presentation-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.draft-presentation.description","lang":"hu","value":"Válaszd ki a piszkozat támogatott formáját: kis lépésenkénti vagy teljes útmutató. A választást a verzió mentése rögzíti."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-draft-presentation-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.draft-presentation.label","lang":"hu","value":"Útmutató formája"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-draft-toggle-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.draft-toggle.description","lang":"hu","value":"Nyisd le vagy csukd össze a piszkozat mezőit. Az összecsukás nem menti a piszkozatot."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-draft-toggle-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.draft-toggle.label","lang":"hu","value":"Piszkozat tartalma"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-header-color-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.header-color.description","lang":"hu","value":"Válaszd ki a piszkozat fejlécének színét. A választás ehhez a verzióhoz tartozik."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-header-color-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.header-color.label","lang":"hu","value":"Fejléc színe"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-image-copy-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-copy.description","lang":"hu","value":"Másold ki a kép hivatkozását a szakasz tartalmához. A másolás nem módosítja a piszkozatot."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-image-copy-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-copy.label","lang":"hu","value":"Képhivatkozás másolása"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-image-pages-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-pages.description","lang":"hu","value":"Válts a képhelyek lapjai között a szakasz képeinek áttekintéséhez vagy szerkesztéséhez."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-image-pages-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-pages.label","lang":"hu","value":"Képlapok"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-image-remove-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-remove.description","lang":"hu","value":"Távolítsd el ezt a képet a piszkozat szakaszából. A módosítást a verzió mentése rögzíti."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-image-remove-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-remove.label","lang":"hu","value":"Kép eltávolítása"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-image-replace-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-replace.description","lang":"hu","value":"Válassz másik képet a szakasz ezen foglalt helyére."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-image-replace-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-replace.label","lang":"hu","value":"Kép cseréje"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-image-upload-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-upload.description","lang":"hu","value":"Válassz képet a szakasz üres helyére. A szakasz képeit a verzió mentése rögzíti."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-image-upload-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.image-upload.label","lang":"hu","value":"Kép hozzáadása"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-overview-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.overview.description","lang":"hu","value":"Kezeld a súgókat, szabályzatokat és szerkeszthető útmutatókat. Válassz nyelvet, ments verziót, majd aktiváld. Az alkalmazás rendszerútmutatói itt nem szerkeszthetők."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-activate-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-activate.description","lang":"hu","value":"Tedd ezt a mentett verziót aktívvá a dokumentumhoz és nyelvhez. A már aktív verzió nem aktiválható újra."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-activate-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-activate.label","lang":"hu","value":"Verzió aktiválása"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-active-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-active.description","lang":"hu","value":"Ez a jelvény mutatja a felhasználóknak jelenleg látható verziót a kiválasztott nyelven."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-active-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-active.label","lang":"hu","value":"Aktív verzió"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-cancel-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-cancel.description","lang":"hu","value":"Zárd be a piszkozatot a módosítások mentése nélkül. A mentett verziók továbbra is elérhetők."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-cancel-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-cancel.label","lang":"hu","value":"Szerkesztés elvetése"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-delete-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-delete.description","lang":"hu","value":"Ezzel a művelettel törölheted a mentett verziót. Előbb ellenőrizd a dokumentumot, a nyelvet és a verziót."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-delete-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-delete.label","lang":"hu","value":"Verzió törlése"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-description-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-description.description","lang":"hu","value":"Írd meg a verzió bevezető leírását."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-description-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-description.label","lang":"hu","value":"Leírás"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-edit-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-edit.description","lang":"hu","value":"Nyiss piszkozatot ebből a verzióból. Új verzió mentése előtt ellenőrizd a tartalmát."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-edit-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-edit.label","lang":"hu","value":"Verzió szerkesztése"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-header-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-header.description","lang":"hu","value":"Add meg a dokumentum vagy útmutató ezen verziójának megjelenő fejlécét."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-header-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-header.label","lang":"hu","value":"Fejléc"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-presentation-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-presentation.description","lang":"hu","value":"A jelvény a mentett verzió formáját mutatja: kis lépésenkénti vagy teljes útmutató. Itt csak olvasható."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-presentation-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-presentation.label","lang":"hu","value":"Útmutató formája"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-save-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-save.description","lang":"hu","value":"Mentsd a piszkozatot új verzióként. Az aktiválás külön művelet a mentett verzión."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-save-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-save.label","lang":"hu","value":"Verzió mentése"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-title-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-title.description","lang":"hu","value":"Adj címet a piszkozatnak, hogy felismerhető legyen a verziólistában."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-title-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-title.label","lang":"hu","value":"Verzió címe"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-toggle-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-toggle.description","lang":"hu","value":"Nyisd le vagy csukd össze a mentett verziót a szakaszok áttekintéséhez. Ettől az aktív verzió nem változik."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-revision-toggle-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.revision-toggle.label","lang":"hu","value":"Verzió tartalma"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-add-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-add.description","lang":"hu","value":"Adj új szakaszt a piszkozathoz, majd töltsd ki a címét és tartalmát. Ez még nem menti a verziót."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-add-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-add.label","lang":"hu","value":"Szakasz hozzáadása"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-guide-target-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-guide-target.description","lang":"hu","value":"Kapcsold ezt a lépést a kiválasztott képernyő egyik elérhető vezérlőjéhez."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-guide-target-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-guide-target.label","lang":"hu","value":"Útmutató célpontja"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-html-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-html.description","lang":"hu","value":"Szerkeszd a szakasz tartalmának HTML-kódját. Mentés előtt az előnézetben ellenőrizd a megjelenést."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-html-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-html.label","lang":"hu","value":"Szakasz HTML-kódja"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-icon-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-icon.description","lang":"hu","value":"Válassz a szakaszt jelölő ikont. A menü keresőjével kereshetsz az ikonok között."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-icon-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-icon.label","lang":"hu","value":"Szakasz ikonja"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-mode-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-mode.description","lang":"hu","value":"Válts a szakasz HTML-kódjának szerkesztése és a megjelenő tartalom előnézete között. A váltás nem menti a verziót."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-mode-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-mode.label","lang":"hu","value":"HTML vagy előnézet"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-optional-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-optional.description","lang":"hu","value":"Állítsd be, hogy a szakasz elfogadása választható vagy kötelező. Aktiválás előtt ellenőrizd a követelményt."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-optional-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-optional.label","lang":"hu","value":"Adatvédelmi követelmény"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-panel-span-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-panel-span.description","lang":"hu","value":"Válaszd ki, mekkora helyet foglaljon el a szakasz a teljes útmutató rácsában."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-panel-span-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-panel-span.label","lang":"hu","value":"Panel szélessége"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-preview-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-preview.description","lang":"hu","value":"Nyisd le vagy csukd össze a mentett szakaszt. A tartalom olvasása nem módosítja azt."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-preview-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-preview.label","lang":"hu","value":"Szakasz olvasása"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-remove-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-remove.description","lang":"hu","value":"Távolítsd el ezt a szakaszt a piszkozatból. Az eltávolítást a verzió mentése rögzíti."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-remove-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-remove.label","lang":"hu","value":"Szakasz eltávolítása"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-title-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-title.description","lang":"hu","value":"Add meg a szakasz dokumentumban vagy útmutatóban megjelenő címét."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-title-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-title.label","lang":"hu","value":"Szakasz címe"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-toggle-description","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-toggle.description","lang":"hu","value":"Nyisd le vagy csukd össze a piszkozat szakaszát a tartalom és a képmezők eléréséhez."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-help-editor-section-toggle-label","key":"guide.admin.help-editor.section-toggle.label","lang":"hu","value":"Szakasz mezői"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-admin-home-overview-description","key":"guide.admin.home.overview.description","lang":"hu","value":"Az avatármenüből nyithatod meg a moderációt, bejelentéseket, visszajelzéseket, háttérfeladatokat és monitorozást. Itt találod az értesítéseket és az útmutatók kapcsolóját is."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-community-voting-row-status-description","key":"guide.community.voting.row-status.description","lang":"hu","value":"A jelvény a leadott szavazatok és a szavazásra jogosultak számát mutatja. Az állás megtekintése, a javaslat megnyitása és a szavazat leadása külön művelet."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-community-voting-row-status-label","key":"guide.community.voting.row-status.label","lang":"hu","value":"A szavazás állása"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-navigation-menu-votes-description","key":"guide.navigation.menu.votes.description","lang":"hu","value":"Nyisd meg a csoport szavazásait és eredményeit. Végleges szavazatod leadása előtt olvasd el a javaslatot."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-navigation-menu-votes-label","key":"guide.navigation.menu.votes.label","lang":"hu","value":"Közösségi szavazások"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-payment-cash-receipt-currency-description","key":"guide.payment.cash.receipt.currency.description","lang":"hu","value":"Válaszd ki a beérkezett befizetés pénznemét. A mentett tétel és az esetleges későbbi visszatérítés ezt az összeget és pénznemet használja."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-payment-cash-receipt-method-description","key":"guide.payment.cash.receipt.method.description","lang":"hu","value":"Válaszd a készpénzt vagy a banki átutalást a kapott befizetésnek megfelelően. A mentés a befizetést rögzíti, nem indít banki átutalást."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-payment-cash-receipt-method-label","key":"guide.payment.cash.receipt.method.label","lang":"hu","value":"Fizetési mód"},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-payment-history-record-cash-description","key":"guide.payment.history.record-cash.description","lang":"hu","value":"Rögzíts már átvett készpénzt vagy beérkezett banki átutalást. Mentés előtt válaszd ki a befizetőt, a fizetési módot, az összeget és a pénznemet."},{"_id":"i18n-message-hu-guide-payment-history-record-cash-label","key":"guide.payment.history.record-cash.label","lang":"hu","value":"Beérkezett befizetés rögzítése"}],"i18n_bundles":[{